# 实时活动 API 基地址（PUBLIC_ 变量会编译进公开 JS，严禁放任何密钥）
# 只填基地址：不带末尾 /，也不要包含 /v1/events。
PUBLIC_EVENTS_API_BASE=https://kamitsubaki-events-api.apikatsuwiki.workers.dev

# 本地联调时可临时指向本机服务，部署前务必恢复：
# PUBLIC_EVENTS_API_BASE=http://localhost:8787
# Public support data. The support page keeps its fallback content if unavailable.
# PUBLIC_SUPPORT_API_BASE=https://api.kamitsubaki.wiki
# Local support backend (do not use this value in a production build):
# PUBLIC_SUPPORT_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8789

# Optional separate API origin for special collaborators; otherwise uses support / existing public API origin.
# PUBLIC_COLLABORATORS_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8789
